This factorization confirms the spectral filtering mechanism: marked contribution to the MSRD (and hence to visibility loss) requires both substantial thermal population (\({B}_{{\mathcal{D}}}\) large) and substantial relative-motion capacity (\((1-{c}_{{\mathcal{D}}})\) large).
